  "key_findings": [
    "MFAP4 single-gene AUROC=0.684 (95% CI 0.5574-0.8049) on the honest GSE63885 cohort (n=75); the committed 0.763 was reachable only by counting 26 unevaluable 'na' samples as sensitive.",
    "MFAP4 is unstable across cohorts (0.529-0.797; SD 0.11), collapsing to chance (0.529) in GSE30161 -> unsuitable as a standalone predictor.",
    "Neither the user STROMAL_CAGE [FAP,POSTN,ACTA2,MFAP4] nor the existing canonical cage beats MFAP4-solo on discrimination (no significant DeLong difference in any cohort: p=0.157/0.666/0.894).",
    "The composite's real advantage is STABILITY: cross-cohort AUROC SD more than halves (0.11 -> 0.046), range tightens (0.529-0.797 -> 0.629-0.729); it never collapses to chance.",
    "Honest positioning: MFAP4 = component input; STROMAL_CAGE = stable stromal-context readout (RUO/hypothesis-generating), NOT a validated high-performance resistance classifier."
  ],
